 \n- Lyrics have been redesigned with smoother synchronization\, tap-to-see
 k\, instrumental breaks\, offline caching\, and alternate versions.\n- Add
 ed broader support for Opus\, Ogg\, FLAC\, AAC/M4A\, DSF\, and DFF files.\
 n- Improved playback stability\, gapless transitions\, seeking\, Bluetooth
 \, CarPlay\, and audio interruption handling.\n- Added appearance options:
